<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Technical hitch hits SAfrica JSE price information.</title>
<headline>Technical hitch hits SAfrica JSE price information.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical hitch hit the feed of share price information to several clients of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange, a bourse spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>She added that the the problem had not disrupted actual trading and had now been fixed. Price information should soon start to flow normally again, she said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
